WEBVTT

00:01:55.520 --> 00:02:00.430
When I was little, I was really weak—a crybaby.

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:06.390
I always cowered from sad or difficult things.

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:09.260
Anyway, all I could do was cry.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:17.240
It’s no use! We can’t put it out!

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:20.150
But there’s a kid up ahead!

00:02:20.150 --> 00:02:21.700
Can’t you do anything about it?

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:24.240
They just reported a mage from the Main Office broke in.

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:25.830
Search for other survivors instead!

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:35.490
Dad?

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:37.570
Sis?

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:51.790
It hurts... and it’s hot...

00:02:51.790 --> 00:02:56.190
I don’t like this... I want to go home!

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:01.440
Help...

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:08.140
Somebody, save me!

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:30.310
Good, I made it. I’ve come to save you.

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:39.530
You’ve done your best, right? That’s impressive!

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:43.930
Everything is okay now.

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:46.820
I’ll take you to a safe place.

00:03:48.440 --> 00:03:50.890
Upward clearance confirmation.

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:58.020
Firing lock, disengaged.

00:03:58.020 --> 00:04:00.470
Let’s pierce through to the surface with one shot.

00:04:00.470 --> 00:04:02.700
All right. Load Cartridge.

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:10.950
Buster set.

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:16.360
<b>Divine...</b>

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:19.230
<b>...Buster</b>

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:33.600
This is Rescue Unit 01.

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:38.980
I’ve rescued a girl from the entrance hall.

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:44.830
Thank you very much...
you’re the flying ace of aces, all right!

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:51.100
After dropping her off with the medical team on the west bank, I’ll resume with the rescue effort.

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:51.940
Yes, please!

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:04.720
I was rescued from the inferno

00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:08.120
and brought into the expansive sky.

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:10.740
The cold wind was gentle,

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:13.690
and the arm embracing me was warm.

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:22.590
The person who saved me was strong, kind, and totally rad.

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:29.970
I was ashamed of myself for
not being able to do anything but sit there and cry.

00:05:33.650 --> 00:05:38.670
Since that time, for the first time in my life, I firmly believed in my heart.

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:45.280
Being able to only cry and to do nothing...

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:46.940
I won’t be like that anymore...

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:56.840
Because I will become stronger.

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:06.160
Subaru, if you move around too much,

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:08.910
those cheap rollerblades are going to fall apart during the exam.

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:13.340
Tia, don’t jinx it!

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:15.270
I oiled them before I came.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:29.060
Good morning.

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:33.700
Now then, are the two mages who will be taking this exam here?

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:34.870
Yes, ma’am!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:37.020
I’m going to confirm your identities, all right?

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:42.610
Is Private First Class Subaru Nakajima of the Time-Space Administrative Bureau’s 386th Battalion present?

00:06:42.610 --> 00:06:43.250
Yes, ma’am!

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:45.640
And Private First Class Teana Lanster?

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:46.170
Yes, ma’am!

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:50.000
You two are currently C rank mages.

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:54.400
Today, you will be taking
the qualifying mage exam for B rank.

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:55.600
I’m not mistaken, am I?

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:56.300
No, ma’am!

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:57.560
You’re not mistaken.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:04.430
Okay! I will be your proctor today,
Command Sergeant Major Reinforce Zwei.

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:05.740
Pleased to meet you!

00:07:06.420 --> 00:07:07.990
The pleasure is ours!

00:07:12.560 --> 00:07:15.490
Ah, they’re already getting started.

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:17.940
Rein is really being a proper examiner, too.

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:24.020
Hayate, it’s dangerous to watch from the door.

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:25.940
You can see it on the monitor anyway.

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:27.510
Okay.

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:34.950
So these two are the ones you picked out, Hayate?

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:39.660
Yes, and both of them have some pretty interesting grades.

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:43.810
Depending on the results of today’s exam—if they make it—will they be officially assigned?

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:48.460
The final decision is in Nanoha’s hands.

00:07:48.460 --> 00:07:49.550
I see.

00:07:49.550 --> 00:07:51.100
If they make it into the unit,

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:53.020
they’ll be under Nanoha’s direct command

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:55.280
and training under her.

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:03.180
No life signs detected within the course,

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:05.810
nor have any dangerous objects been detected.

00:08:06.950 --> 00:08:08.690
Check of the course was finished.

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:12.470
Thank you, Raising Heart.

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:17.300
The surveillence searchers and the Auto-Spheres’ obstruction field calibrations are done.

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.920
Shall we just sit back and watch the show?

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:22.260
Yes, my master.

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:24.640
You two will start here.

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:27.850
Your objective is to destroy the point targets.

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:32.700
Oh, and of course, there are dummy targets which you mustn’t destroy, understand?

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:36.900
Be careful of incoming attacks, and destroy all the targets.

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:40.310
Also, be sure to reach the finish line
before the timer runs out.

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:42.130
Are there any questions?

00:08:42.130 --> 00:08:43.120
Hmm...

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:44.440
No.

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:46.170
None.

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:48.420
Well then, we’ll be starting in just a bit.

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:51.170
I’ll see ya at the finish!

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:58.600
Ready...

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:01.120
...go!

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:05.340
It’s starting!

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:06.940
Let’s see what they’ve got.

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:14.530
Subaru...

00:09:18.780 --> 00:09:21.320
I’ll take the targets inside!

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:22.180
I’m letting you go...

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:23.200
Okay!

00:09:42.230 --> 00:09:43.640
<b>Load Cartridge</b>

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:48.590
<b>Revolver...</b>

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:51.980
<b>...Shoot</b>

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:02.920
Calm down...

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:03.970
Take it easy.

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:33.130
Nice timing!

00:10:33.130 --> 00:10:33.980
Of course!

00:10:34.930 --> 00:10:36.270
They make a good pair.

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:38.930
They are, but the hard part is yet to come.

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:42.120
Especially when <i>this</i> makes its appearance.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:46.300
That last challenge at which more than half of all examinees are defeated,

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:47.910
the Large-Scale Auto-Sphere.

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:52.230
Looking at that pair’s skill now,
it would normally be hard to defend against or evade it.

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:55.450
The Sphere uses medium-and-long-range attacks,
making it a difficult opponent.

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:57.380
How will they get past it?

00:10:57.380 --> 00:11:00.300
They’ll have to show their experience and guts.

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:08.150
Let’s do it to it!

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:10.480
Subaru, shut up!

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:52.690
Good! All clear.

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:53.840
What’s up next?

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:57.650
If we keep heading up,
we’ll come under more concentrated fire.

00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:01.090
Utilizing Optic Hide, we’ll sneak up and destroy the spheres with Cross Shift.

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:02.510
Let’s do it!

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:03.960
Roger!

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:26.830
Five...

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:30.690
Four...

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:34.520
Three...

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:38.680
Two...

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:44.580
One...

00:12:48.510 --> 00:12:49.390
Zero!

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:51.310
<b>Crossfire...</b>

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:53.230
<b>Revolver...</b>

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:58.160
<b>...Shoot</b>

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:09.490
I see! They certainly <i>do</i> look promising.

00:13:10.790 --> 00:13:11.940
I told you they do.

00:13:11.940 --> 00:13:14.040
Now all that’s left is the final challenge.

00:13:14.040 --> 00:13:17.940
Yay! Nice one, Tia! We finished it in one blow!

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:20.300
Well, that’s because we’ve got so much time.

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:24.290
These enemies don’t seem all that difficult...

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:26.930
Tia, you must be strong after all!

00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:30.030
Shut it! Hurry up and finish this
so we can move on—

00:13:33.160 --> 00:13:34.330
Subaru, get down!

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:40.650
Tia!

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:47.830
What happened?

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:51.180
It seems the searcher was hit by a stray bullet.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:55.030
I wonder if they’re in trouble?

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:57.550
Rein, I’m going to take a look, just in case, all right?

00:13:57.550 --> 00:13:59.560
Yes indeedy, please go ahead.

00:14:00.050 --> 00:14:01.500
Do you want me to set up too?

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:04.440
I suppose. Just to be sure, please.

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:07.700
All right. Barrier Jacket standing up.

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:09.910
Tia!

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:13.240
Don’t make a fuss! It’s nothing.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:14.290
Don’t lie!

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:16.730
You tripped! It’s sprained, isn’t it?

00:14:16.730 --> 00:14:17.810
I told you it’s noth—

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:27.050
Tia, I’m sorry. I let my guard down.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:28.870
It was because of my carelessness.

00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:31.280
If you apologize, I’ll be mad when we get back.

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:34.100
It looks like I can’t run anymore.

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:36.230
I won’t be able to pass the last test.

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:37.640
Tia...

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:40.400
I’ll keep my distance and support you.

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:43.220
That way you can make it to the finish by yourself.

00:14:43.220 --> 00:14:44.070
Tia!

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.140
Shut up!

00:14:45.140 --> 00:14:48.510
I’m telling you that at the next exam I will pass by myself!

00:14:48.510 --> 00:14:49.760
The next one?

00:14:49.760 --> 00:14:50.950
That’s more than a half a year away!

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:53.360
Rather than being a load and dragging you down,

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:55.520
I feel more comfortable doing it this way.

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:57.060
If you understand that, then hurr—

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:01.540
Look, just hurry up!

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:05.750
Tia, I told you before, didn’t I?

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:11.450
How I hated myself for being weak, useless, and always wanting help from others?

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:13.680
That’s why I joined the Bureau and enlisted in the G.A.S.

00:15:15.140 --> 00:15:16.940
Aiming to become a mage,

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:19.110
studying magic and Shooting Arts,

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:21.040
and finally working to save people.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:23.910
I know that. Even though I didn’t want to hear it,

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:25.560
you told me many times over anyway.

00:15:26.560 --> 00:15:29.320
Because we’ve always been together, Tia.

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:34.000
What you dream to become, and why you’re working so hard to raise your mage rank,

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:35.810
your anxiety and your hard work...

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:36.990
I know them too well!

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:42.580
That’s why, in a place like this, right in front of me,

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:45.070
to see you fail to achieve
your dream when it’s so close to you...

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:45.940
I don’t want that!

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:48.880
And I definitely don’t want to finish this alone!

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:50.900
Then what are you going to do?

00:15:50.900 --> 00:15:52.800
Trying to cover for someone who can’t even run,

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:55.760
in the short amount of time we have left,
how are you going to reach the finish line?

00:15:56.860 --> 00:15:57.720
We’ll use <i>that</i> trick.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:16:00.670
It might be against the rules if we get caught,

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:03.490
and I’m not sure if I can do it properly,

00:16:03.490 --> 00:16:05.150
but if it goes well, we can both reach the finish!

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:07.130
Really?

00:16:07.130 --> 00:16:15.170
Oh, uh... well... see, it might be a little hard,
and it’ll require you to push yourself a little bit.

00:16:15.170 --> 00:16:18.060
When I think about it, it might be a bit too reckless...

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:24.000
How do I say it? But if you’re okay with it, then—

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:25.950
This is so annoying!

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:30.880
No matter what you’re going to say,
you’ll still follow your selfish decision, right?

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.950
You’re going to make me go along with your selfishness anyway, right?

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:36.090
If so, then just say it clearly!

00:16:39.050 --> 00:16:41.550
If we do it together, we can pull it off.

00:16:41.550 --> 00:16:43.010
Believe in me, Tia.

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:48.500
3 minutes and 40 seconds remaining.

00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:49.650
What’s the plan?

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:51.570
Right on!

00:16:55.980 --> 00:16:58.270
Hey, she came out!

00:16:58.270 --> 00:16:59.940
Yes... well, that’s odd..

00:16:59.940 --> 00:17:01.230
However...

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:16.840
A direct hit!

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:17.930
No, not quite.

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:28.140
High-speed evasion? No, that’s not it...

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:30.490
That Tia is a decoy.

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:31.610
Then that means...

00:17:40.130 --> 00:17:41.930
Fake Silhouette

00:17:41.930 --> 00:17:44.510
This uses up an excessive amount of mana.

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:47.070
I can’t hold it for too long.

00:17:47.070 --> 00:17:52.000
Finish it with a single blow,
so we’ll both have it easier.

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:53.200
Right.

00:17:57.580 --> 00:18:01.590
I can’t fly in the sky,
and I don’t have Tia’s technique.

00:18:01.590 --> 00:18:04.590
I don’t have any decently ranged attacks, either.

00:18:04.590 --> 00:18:10.020
The only thing I can do is to run full-speed and finish it with one shot at close range.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:18.200
After all, I’ve decided to be like <i>her!</i>

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:19.360
To be strong!

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:25.320
To be able to protect someone or something on my own!

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:30.200
<b>Wingroad</b>

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:50.140
Let’s do it!

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:56.020
Here I go!

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:46.770
With a single blow!

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:52.670
<b>Divine Buster</b>

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:09.620
You did it!

00:20:09.620 --> 00:20:10.600
Somehow...

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:13.560
There’s only about a minute remaining, Subaru!

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:14.200
Got it!

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:25.370
Here they come!

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:33.570
How many seconds left?

00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:35.980
Sixteen seconds. We can still make it!

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:41.050
Okay, all targets cleared!

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:43.970
Full mana ahead!

00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:52.730
Subaru, you <i>are</i> thinking about how we’re going to stop, right?

00:20:52.730 --> 00:20:53.500
Huh?

00:20:57.260 --> 00:20:58.360
Oh no!

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:00.820
Ah, this doesn’t look good.

00:21:11.220 --> 00:21:14.180
An Active Guard with a Holding Net should do it.

00:21:14.180 --> 00:21:17.100
Active Guard with Holding Net

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:41.150
Grrr...

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:44.070
You two! Minus points for dangerous maneuvers!

00:21:44.070 --> 00:21:48.180
You should try your best, but not if you get hurt!

00:21:48.180 --> 00:21:50.950
Because of that, you’ll be no good as mages!

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:52.890
Tiny...

00:21:52.890 --> 00:21:54.400
Honestly!

00:21:55.670 --> 00:21:56.390
Now, now...

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:01.170
That was a little surprising,
but it’s good to know you’re safe.

00:22:02.530 --> 00:22:04.770
For the time being, the exam is over.

00:22:04.770 --> 00:22:05.630
Thanks for the hard work.

00:22:13.680 --> 00:22:15.630
Rein, thanks for the hard work also.

00:22:15.630 --> 00:22:17.820
You’ve become a real proctor.

00:22:17.820 --> 00:22:20.990
Yaaaaay! Thank you so much, Nanoha!

00:22:24.930 --> 00:22:27.780
Well, let’s leave the details for later.

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:30.230
Private First Class Lanster.

00:22:30.230 --> 00:22:31.490
Yes, ma’am?

00:22:31.490 --> 00:22:33.110
You injured your foot, didn’t you?

00:22:33.110 --> 00:22:35.110
I’ll treat it. Can you take off your boot?

00:22:35.110 --> 00:22:37.670
If she needs treatment, I’ll do it!

00:22:37.670 --> 00:22:41.620
Thanks... sorry to trouble you.

00:22:41.620 --> 00:22:44.050
Nanoha?

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:48.220
I mean, Instructor Takamachi...

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:49.920
No, Captain!

00:22:49.920 --> 00:22:51.920
Nanoha is fine.

00:22:51.920 --> 00:22:53.590
That’s what everyone else calls me.

00:22:53.590 --> 00:22:54.850
It’s been four years, right?

00:22:54.850 --> 00:22:56.870
You’ve really gotten taller, Subaru.

00:22:57.840 --> 00:23:00.800
Well.. uh... ah...

00:23:01.760 --> 00:23:04.220
I’m glad to see you again.

00:23:20.000 --> 00:23:24.930
Well then, how well did those two do in Nanoha’s eyes?
I wonder if they passed.

00:23:26.150 --> 00:23:27.230
I wonder...

00:25:17.990 --> 00:25:22.120
The incident at the airport
four years ago started it all.

00:25:22.120 --> 00:25:24.900
Inside the burning flames
there were many encounters,

00:25:24.900 --> 00:25:27.200
and it was the beginning of many determinations.

00:25:33.800 --> 00:25:35.630
Take off!
